  "testId": "testClasses.webstore.productListingPage.ProductListingPageTest#verifyPageLinks",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Checks the PLP home link, then opens Tools and follows three sub-category tiles (two with products, one empty showing 'No records found.'), returning by the breadcrumb each time.",
    "steps": [
      "Click the home link, verify Featured Products heading",
      "Open Tools from the menu",
      "Click sub-category tile 1, verify its heading, breadcrumb back",
      "Click sub-category tile 2, verify its heading, breadcrumb back",
      "Click the empty sub-category tile, verify heading and 'No records found.', breadcrumb back"
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "category"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "None"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "Sub-category headings",
      "No records found message on the empty sub-category"
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Independent method. Tools PLP: every method that opens Tools from the menu (independent methods, no dependsOn) declares its own tools = CATEGORY_WITH_PRODUCTS {store, minProducts 65, minSubcategories 3, topLevel true}, preferred the sheet label (homePage!B16 'Tools' = CategoryCode Tools), with identical params in every method so normal and fallback runs resolve the same category. minProducts 65: the 64 page size must fill and the sort checks read a second page (verifyListIsInZToAOrder clicks the right arrow).",
      "subcategories = CATEGORY_SUBCATEGORY_LINKS_OF_CATEGORY (NEW key and query, pending) {store, categoryId @tools.categoryId, minWithProducts 2, minEmpty 1}: CATEGORY_WITH_PRODUCTS gives sub-category names but neither the tile selector nor an empty sub-category. The tiles are found by data-test-selector 'para' + CategoryCode + 'Category' (sheet HandToolsCategory / PowerToolsAndAccessoriesCategory / PowerToolAccessoriesCategory; DB codes HandTools 88, PowerToolsAndAccessories 87, PowerToolAccessories 156, all children of 86 in catalog 5); headings are the upper-case names.",
      "Sheet values: HandToolsCategory -> subcategories.subcategory1LinkCode, HAND TOOLS -> subcategory1Name, PowerToolsAndAccessoriesCategory -> subcategory2LinkCode, POWER TOOLS -> subcategory2Name, PowerToolAccessoriesCategory -> emptySubcategoryLinkCode, POWER TOOL ACCESSORIES -> emptySubcategoryName. 'No records found.' is a UI text (expected-output).",
      "Store: openWebstoreUrl opens automation_webStoreUrl (atstage: webstore-z10-atstage, the main store MaxwellsHardware), the same store as the Selenium pdp/quickOrder entries.",
      "Profile: work/profiles/profile.json has no observations for these Selenium cells (profiled false); DB facts from bin/tda rows (2026-11-10) where cited.",
      "Scanned constant values (locators, report messages, map key prefixes, regex) are framework constants: role config, no need.",
      "migrate: Selenium reads Excel tables through TestData.getMap / getHashMap; there is no swap for Selenium."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": true
  },
  "requires": [
    {
      "key": "CATEGORY_WITH_PRODUCTS",
      "alias": "tools",
      "params": {
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "minProducts": 65,
        "minSubcategories": 3,
        "topLevel": true
      },
      "preferred": {
        "source": 5,
        "required": false
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "CATEGORY_SUBCATEGORY_LINKS_OF_CATEGORY",
